- op: discuss  # ef54
  at: '2026-03-08T08:30:10Z'  # ef54
  by: agent  # ef54
  actor: jgstern_agent  # ef54
  clock: 2  # ef54
  nonce: ef54  # ef54
  message: "Phoenix bakeoff assessment: module-qualified calls like Plug.Builder.compile() resolve to Phoenix.Digester.compile by bare name. Stream.run() resolves to Mix.Tasks.Local.Phx.run. Kernel.inspect resolves to Phoenix.Socket.Message.inspect (inflating in-degree to 158). Fix: when Elixir source has module-qualified call, only match target in that module. TDD: write failing test with qualified Elixir call, assert no cross-module false positive. Also: defp (private function) calls within same module not linked as callee edges."  # ef54
